      "content": "i mean i know i should check with someone but i'm just so busy and i really don't want to spend hours in an urgent care waiting room for something that's probably just a little bump. feels like something i can handle. i have some ginger tea and some magnesium at home, would that be a good combo to take right now to help me feel steady? i just want to be able to look at my screen again without feeling like the room is spinning.",
